2D annulus hydro-mechanical coupling (transport part)
TransientTransport nsteps 100 deltat 1.0 alpha 1.0 nmodules 1 profileopt 1
vtkxmllattice tstep_step 1 dofman_all primvars 1 5
domain 2dMassLatticeTransport
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 2 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 0
simpletransportcs 1 mat 1
latticetransmat 1 d 1.e3 k 1.e-19 vis 1.e-3 thetas 1. thetar 0. contype 0 c 0. ctor 0.001
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue 0.0
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue -1.0e6
PiecewiseLinFunction 1 t 2 0.0 100.0 f(t) 2 0.0 1.0
